# DCE CONVERT - Environment Variables Example
# In Netlify: Site configuration -> Environment variables

# 1. CloudConvert API Keys (rotator pool)
# You can provide multiple comma-separated keys or individual CLOUDCONVERT_API_KEY_1, _2, etc.
CLOUDCONVERT_API_KEY="key1,key2,key3"

# 2. ConvertAPI Secret (Backup engine when CloudConvert runs out of credits)
CONVERTAPI_SECRET="your_convertapi_secret_here"
